      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَفَذُّ</span></b>  An arrow <i>having no feathers upon it;</i> (T,
O, K;) opposed to <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرِيشً</span>: so says Aboo-Málik:
others say <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَقَذٌّ</span> [q. v.], with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ق</span>: but he allowed
only the former. (T, O.)

